fix(team-payment: reject anonymous principal in RequirePrincipal (security)

Same class as the promotion unauth bug: RequirePrincipal only checked id != "", so the gateway's anonymous principal (id="anonymous") passed. All RequirePrincipal-gated RPCs here are user-scoped (bind to principal.id) — anonymous would have shared one identity across guests. Now reject anonymous id/type.

